          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which state has the most wage inequality?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "New York, by the Gini of payroll wages across occupations (0.308 in May 2025). By the pay needed to be in the top 10% compared with the median, California is first. Maine is the most equal by the Gini."
          }
